<title>UK: Reuters 10th UK-Asia/M.East aircargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 10th UK-Asia/M.East aircargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average</p>
<p>ex-UK to Asia/Australasia/Middle East GBP air cargo market rates</p>
<p>per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of</p>
<p>six-to-one.</p>
<p>		July 14		    June 23</p>
<p>			NORTH/EAST ASIA</p>
<p>LON-HKG     1.04			 1.10</p>
<p>LON-TYO     1.80			 1.87</p>
<p>LON-PEK     1.50			 1.50</p>
<p>LON-SEL     1.58			 1.60</p>
<p>LON-SHA     1.62			 1.55</p>
<p>LON-TPE     1.21			 1.18</p>
<p>		SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALASIA</p>
<p>LON-AKL     1.95			 2.20</p>
<p>LON-BKK     1.08			 1.08</p>
<p>LON-JAK     1.16			 1.09</p>
<p>LON-KUL     1.04			 1.07</p>
<p>LON-MNL     1.30			 1.30</p>
<p>LON-SIN     1.00			 1.05</p>
<p>LON-SYD     1.85			 1.87</p>
<p>	     MIDDLE EAST/SOUTH ASIA</p>
<p>LON-BAH     0.90			 0.83</p>
<p>LON-DXB     0.66			 0.67</p>
<p>LON-BOM     0.78			 0.74</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smallcargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
